	(descr "Wurth WP-BUCF REDCUBE PRESS-FIT 7461059: brass terminal 13.0 x 13.0 mm, 13.5 mm tall, internal M6 thread, 16 press-fit pins on the perimeter of a 5 x 5 grid, 2.54 mm pitch (10.16 mm span). Per Wurth drawing 7461059 rev 001.003 (2025-02-04): PCB drill 1.60 -0.03, finished hole 1.475 +-0.05 chemical finish (ENIG) / 1.45 +-0.05 HAL, plating 25-60 um Cu, land >= 0.10 beyond the drill. Pad 2.0 mm (0.2 ring over the 1.60 drill). Hole here is the ENIG finished size, 1.475. All 16 pins are pad 1 (one net). Press-fit only, no soldering; insertion 40 N/pin (~640 N), keep other parts >= 3 mm from the holes (courtyard)")
	(tags "Wurth REDCUBE press-fit M6 terminal 7461059 WP-BUCF")
